            Details how NXdata instance were processed from detector readings/raw data.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXimage.html#nximage-process-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
