                Examples are gallium, helium, neon, argon, krypton,
                or xenon, O2+.
            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXibeam_column.html#nxibeam-column-ion-source-probe-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
