  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
            Individual storage of each triangle.
            Users are advised that using such individual storage of primitives
            may be less storage efficient than creating a combined storage.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXcg_triangle.html#nxcg-triangle-triangleid-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
