  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NXcanSAS/ENTRY/TRANSMISSION_SPECTRUM</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
        The *SAStransmission_spectrum* element
        
        This describes certain data obtained from a variable-wavelength source
        such as pulsed-neutron source.
        
        
        The name of each *SAStransmission_spectrum* group must be unique within a SASentry group.  
        Suggest using names such as ``sastransmission_spectrum01``.
      </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXcanSAS.html#nxcansas-entry-transmission-spectrum-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

