  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
                        Sensor measuring the applied voltage.
                        
                        In most cases, this can be a link to /entry/instrument/manipulator/sample_bias_voltmeter
                        if a manipulator is present in the instrument.
                    </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXmpes.html#nxmpes-entry-sample-bias-env-voltmeter-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
