                    this field stores how many scan points of the map were identified as matching best
                    with this phase.
                </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXem_ebsd.html#nxem-ebsd-indexing-phaseid-number-of-scan-points-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
