            If depends_on is not provided, it is assumed that the mask
            applies to its direct parent.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXcs_filter_boolean_mask.html#nxcs-filter-boolean-mask-depends-on-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
