  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXcs_filter_boolean_mask.html#nxcs-filter-boolean-mask-number-of-objects-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
