  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
             Alias for surface_area of each primitive.
             
             Set to NaN if does not apply for primitives for which is_closed is False.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXcg_primitive.html#nxcg-primitive-area-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
