  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
             Direction unit vector which points along the
             longest principal axis of each primitive.
             
             Use the depends_on attribute to specify in which coordinate system
             these direction unit vectors are defined.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXcg_primitive.html#nxcg-primitive-orientation-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
