  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
                        Associated lower :math:`[e_{min}, e_{max}]` bounds of the
                        energy which is assumed associated with this peak.
                    </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXem_eds.html#nxem-eds-indexing-peak-atom-energy-range-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
