  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
                The value can be extracted from the CRunHeader.fMcpEfficiency
                field of a CamecaRoot RHIT file.
            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXapm_instrument.html#nxapm-instrument-ion-detector-mcp-efficiency-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
