            spatial dispersive, momentum dispersive, non-dispersive, etc.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXcollectioncolumn.html#nxcollectioncolumn-scheme-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

