  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NXcanSAS/ENTRY/INSTRUMENT/SOURCE/wavelength_min</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
            Some facilities specify wavelength using a range. 
            This is the lowest wavelength in such a range.
          </rdfs:comment>
