                    a free text description.
                </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXoptical_spectroscopy.html#nxoptical-spectroscopy-entry-sample-substrate-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
