  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"> Values to use to normalise for time-variations in photon flux. Typically, the synchrotron storage ring
              electron beam current is used as a proxy for the X-ray beam intensity. Array must have same shape as the
              NXdata groups.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXstxm.html#nxstxm-entry-control-data-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

