  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
                            Only one of ``pass_energy`` or ``drift_energy`` should be supplied. ``drift_energy`` should be used if a TOF is used in the
                            energy dispersive part of the electron analyzer.
                        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXmpes.html#nxmpes-entry-instrument-electronanalyzer-energydispersion-drift-energy-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
