                                axis.
                                
                                This is typically the slower scan axis compared to ``spatial0``.
                            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXmpes.html#nxmpes-entry-instrument-electronanalyzer-electron-detector-raw-data-spatial1-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
